msgid ""
"**Status:** Accepted (Milestone `v1.3.1`, Issue "
"[#309](https://github.com/bdperkin/findfmt/issues/309))."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/sidebar_navigation.md:83
#: 2d520a518f024008bbecbdd18ee72c59
msgid ""
"**Selected Depth:** `SIDEBAR_NAVIGATION_MAXDEPTH = 4` (`:maxdepth: 4` "
"across root and section toctrees)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/sidebar_navigation.md:86
#: 43787bb8f19c4aeaac8b972e7e810826
msgid "3.1. Sphinx Event Hook (`docs/source/conf.py`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/sidebar_navigation.md:88
#: 5436a1a55e774080995edb9421c468a9
msgid ""
"`docs/source/conf.py` registers `_configure_hierarchical_sidebar` on "
"Sphinx's `html-page-context` event at `priority=600` (running immediately"
" after Furo's built-in `_html_page_context` handler at `priority=500`):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/sidebar_navigation.md:92
#: dd7d593aa6f54923a1c60c22e52e1831
msgid ""
"Invokes `context[\"toctree\"](collapse=False, titles_only=False, "
"maxdepth=4, includehidden=True)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/sidebar_navigation.md:93
#: c7061fce8b5042188b1731be84375784
msgid ""
"Passes the resulting HTML fragment through "
"`furo.navigation.get_navigation_tree()` so every page and heading level "
"(`toctree-l1` through `toctree-l4`) receives native collapsible "
"checkboxes and chevron labels:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/sidebar_navigation.md:96
#: 5724e40224a44a1695992994005950de
msgid ""
"**User Guides (`guides/index.md`):** Expands from guide titles "
"(`Installation`, `Configuration`, etc.) into `H2` sections (`1. "
"Installation Methods`, `2. Platform Notes`, `3. Verification & "
"Diagnostics`) and `H3` subsections (`1.1. Standalone Execution with "
"uvx`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/sidebar_navigation.md:99
#: 31de2d590b0441f0bd264fd459f8127a
msgid ""
"**CLI Reference (`cli/index.md`):** Expands directly into `1. Synopsis`, "
"`2. Description`, `3. Options` (`3.1. Tag Filtering`, `3.2. Traversal "
"Controls`, `3.3. Output Controls`, `3.4. Information & Diagnostics`), and"
" `8. Examples`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/sidebar_navigation.md:102
#: 447eabb549e3424d959507992607305e
msgid ""
"**API Reference (`api/findfmt.md`):** Expands `Package Modules` into "
"module sections (`1. Core Data Models (findfmt.models)`, `2. File "
"Classifier (findfmt.classifier)`, etc.) and individual class and function"
" anchors (`FileInfo`, `TraversalConfig`, `classify_file()`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/sidebar_navigation.md:106
#: c2127716f117473ea67b55533b89f054
msgid ""
"3.2. Accessibility & Mobile Responsiveness (`navigation.html` & "
"`custom.css`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/sidebar_navigation.md:108
#: f86362e9fd1b4f678fb2981ed0596a9d
msgid ""
"**Landmark Labeling:** `docs/source/_templates/sidebar/navigation.html` "
"adds `aria-label=\"{{ _('Navigation') }}\"` to `.sidebar-tree`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/sidebar_navigation.md:110
#: 7befd2b0063547cdbf74dd5136a1acef
msgid ""
"**Keyboard Switch Focus:** Stock Furo styles `.toctree-checkbox` with "
"`display: none`, which removes the `<input type=\"checkbox\" "
"role=\"switch\">` elements from the keyboard tab order. "
"`docs/source/_static/custom.css` overrides `.sidebar-tree .toctree-"
"checkbox` to remain positioned over the toggle button with `opacity: 0` "
"and adds a high-contrast `:focus-visible` outline on the sibling "
"`<label>`, enabling keyboard users to tab through and toggle any nested "
"heading branch with `Space`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quality/sidebar_navigation.md:116
#: aede729d69cd4d02bb624369f4e63253
msgid ""
"**Visual Hierarchy & Mobile Drawer:** Subtle left border guides on "
"`.toctree-l2 > ul` and `.toctree-l3 > ul` visually distinguish nested "
"heading levels in both desktop viewports and the slide-out mobile "
"navigation drawer across light and dark Furo themes."
msgstr ""
